What does this method compute?

```java
public int countValue(ArrayList<Integer> list, int target) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < list.size(); i++) {
        if (list.get(i) == target) {
            count++;
        }
    }
    return count;
}
```

What does this method compute for `list = [3, 7, 2, 9]`?

```java
public int findMax(ArrayList<Integer> list) {
    int max = list.get(0);
    for (int i = 1; i < list.size(); i++) {
        if (list.get(i) > max) {
            max = list.get(i);
        }
    }
    return max;
}
```

What does this method do?

```java
public void removeAllNegatives(ArrayList<Integer> list) {
    for (int i = list.size() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        if (list.get(i) < 0) {
            list.remove(i);
        }
    }
}
```

What does this method compute for `list = ["a", "bb", "ccc"]`?

```java
public int totalLength(ArrayList<String> list) {
    int total = 0;
    for (String s : list) {
        total += s.length();
    }
    return total;
}
```

